{"3982380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Smashies!", "steam_appid": 3982380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, you’ve been overlooked. Stepped on. Kicked down the road by kids with nothing better to do. Parked on by cars. Ignored by the world. You were just part of the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982380/extras/0d58f12540164651468af57743fbd49d.avif?t=1762719458\" alt=\"An explosive hazard sign with Rock Man wearing a safety cone hat\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Rock Man, an ancient rolling force of chaos. Smash, bounce, and launch yourself through a world that never sits still. Everything resets, repairs, and reshuffles, but secrets and discoveries carry on, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you are knocking a cat out of a tree to save it, the next you are bowling through buildings or finding yourself inside a giant pinball machine. The world is unpredictable, the destruction is cathartic, and the chaos is endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Vibes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, chaotic fun with a touch of discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that repairs itself but hides lasting secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that mixes destruction, randomness, and surprise</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What You Can Do</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock mini games like marble runs, cannons, pinball boards, mazes, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy, rebuild, and rediscover the world in unexpected ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on quirky missions, from helping animals to cheering up a grumpy crab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase achievements, track scores, and earn silly rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that’s only the beginning. At any moment, you can morph into a hulking, physics-driven boulder, rolling downhill like a force of nature. Smash through storefronts, pancake vehicles, and turn city squares into gravel pits. The faster you go, the bigger the mess you make.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, you’ve been overlooked. Stepped on. Kicked down the road by kids with nothing better to do. Parked on by cars. Ignored by the world. You were just part of the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982380/extras/0d58f12540164651468af57743fbd49d.avif?t=1762719458\" alt=\"An explosive hazard sign with Rock Man wearing a safety cone hat\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become Rock Man, an ancient rolling force of chaos. Smash, bounce, and launch yourself through a world that never sits still. Everything resets, repairs, and reshuffles, but secrets and discoveries carry on, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you are knocking a cat out of a tree to save it, the next you are bowling through buildings or finding yourself inside a giant pinball machine. The world is unpredictable, the destruction is cathartic, and the chaos is endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Vibes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, chaotic fun with a touch of discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that repairs itself but hides lasting secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that mixes destruction, randomness, and surprise</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What You Can Do</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock mini games like marble runs, cannons, pinball boards, mazes, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy, rebuild, and rediscover the world in unexpected ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on quirky missions, from helping animals to cheering up a grumpy crab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase achievements, track scores, and earn silly rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that’s only the beginning. At any moment, you can morph into a hulking, physics-driven boulder, rolling downhill like a force of nature. Smash through storefronts, pancake vehicles, and turn city squares into gravel pits. The faster you go, the bigger the mess you make.</p>", "short_description": "A chaotic physics-driven action game where you roll, smash, and launch through a destructible world full of mini games, quirky missions, and endless surprises.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982380/ad7dd1c979f45ab8fd3fcf9b97a831403190167c/header.jpg?t=1762719458", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982380/bb7e410bee62a693ae38979b0f52bd9f5e4e261b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762719458", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982380/bb7e410bee62a693ae38979b0f52bd9f5e4e261b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762719458", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 4960K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 Ti (4GB Vram<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong